- 0: Data with this ID is filtered.
- 1: Data with this ID is received. bit[0]: Channel RX enable for data with the ID 0 bit[1]: Channel RX enable for data with the ID 1 bit[2]: Channel RX enable for data with the ID 2 bit[3]: Channel RX enable for data with the ID 3";
            sw = rw; hw = r;
            reset = 0xf;
        } chn0_id[3:0];
